      "order": 2,
      "bbox": [
        203,
        191,
        215,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "καίπερ πολλὰ πείθοντι. τέλος δὲ ὁ μὲν νεανίας αὐτὸν ἐν τῇ οἰκίᾳ ἐνέκλεισεν,",
      "lang": "grc",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 3,
      "bbox": [
        218,
        191,
        230,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ὁ δὲ ἀπορῶν ἐπειρᾶτο φεύγειν, πολλοῖς λόγοις χρώμενος. ἀλλὰ οὐκ ἐδύνατο",
      "lang": "grc",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        232,
        191,
        244,
        638
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "λαθεῖν τοὺς δούλους τοὺς τὴν οἰκίαν φυλάττοντας.",
      "lang": "grc",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        247,
